When you come back to a discovered trap, you may forget there
is a trap there if there is an object on it, hiding it.

I suggest that if the character tries to step on a discovered-but-hidden
trap, nethack will ask

Really step on the XXX trap? [ynq]

(XXX stands for the type of the trap)


